.TH grex-status 1  "grex-status "
.SH NAME
grex\-status \- Report drift vs lockfile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrex\-status\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPACK_ROOT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report drift vs lockfile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPACK_ROOT\fR]
Pack root to inspect. Directory holding `.grex/pack.yaml`, or the YAML file itself. When omitted, defaults to the current working directory (v1.3.1 B2 cwd\-default)
